{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":27,\"title\":\"9 Songs\",\"tagline\":\"2 lovers, one summer, and the 9 songs that defined them.\",\"overview\":\"Matt, a young glaciologist, soars across the vast, silent, icebound immensities of the South Pole as he recalls his love affair with Lisa. They meet at a mobbed rock concert in a vast music hall - London's Brixton Academy. They are in bed at night's end. Together, over a period of several months, they pursue a mutual sexual passion whose inevitable stages unfold in counterpoint to nine live-concert songs.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/91O7z0vo7MiNWd5xD2BoivwbQsb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bybAHw5fenKXRFI4phanPhpljlT.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"voteCount\":615,\"year\":2004,\"runtime\":70,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"}],\"budget\":1000000,\"revenue\":1574623,\"director\":\"Michael Winterbottom\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":172,\"name\":\"Michael Winterbottom\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r4cpuukDMG3xLS8tEaTV7X2IxnO.jpg\"},{\"id\":176,\"name\":\"Kieran O'Brien\",\"character\":\"Matt\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wKYN1MvjYIJTYtXVFtlqWK84SMp.jpg\"},{\"id\":177,\"name\":\"Margo Stilley\",\"character\":\"Lisa\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nUuhYYiKp1Ii0S25PqSxQjfYKMk.jpg\"},{\"id\":1759241,\"name\":\"Courtney Taylor-Taylor\",\"character\":\"Himself - The Dandy Warhols (uncredited)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/m0lsvVWIAWsli6rvrpsFW6zuVTu.jpg\"},{\"id\":1759261,\"name\":\"Alex Kapranos\",\"character\":\"Himself - Franz Ferdinand (uncredited)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kh9k3JQQAXbzTpgZDSY4NigYd4x.jpg\"},{\"id\":1357012,\"name\":\"Guy Garvey\",\"character\":\"Himself - Elbow (uncredited)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wm3XN35TBOf2r9K2MLnhhB3dJ