ed musician Jackson Maine discovers — and falls in love with — struggling artist Ally. She has just about given up on her dream to make it big as a singer — until Jack coaxes her into the spotlight. But even as Ally's career takes off, the personal side of their relationship is breaking down, as Jack fights an ongoing battle with his own internal demons.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":824,\"title\":\"Moulin Rouge!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2kjM5CUZRIU5yOANUowrbJcRL9L.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vvcLSgiviCIU0J0UcwLqWdU8Iup.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A celebration of love and creative inspiration takes place in the infamous, gaudy and glamorous Parisian nightclub, at the cusp of the 20th century. A young poet, who is plunged into the heady world of Moulin Rouge, begins a passionate affair with the club's most notorious and beautiful star.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":69,\"title\":\"Walk the Line\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p8lPTjvjOjTfvC1E9pmMwcF9vkn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pMBKzEotLUzk3NuQiyVjZEDlH70.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A chronicle of country music legend Johnny Cash's life, from his early days on an Arkansas cotton farm to his rise to fame with Sun Records in Memphis, where he recorded alongside Elvis Presley, Jerry Lee Lewis and Carl Perkins.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":6282,\"title\":\"Coyote Ugly\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xYM0laKrEqjiRSQNvqRrXPXN3iL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f2MzXz3vjuNtSPn17ugFa6oTUmc.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Graced with a velvet voice, 21-year-old Violet Sanford heads to New York to pursue her dream of becoming a songwriter on